@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+### Changed
+- When saving fails, only the navbar and its menus are highlighted in red. Dropdowns and popovers opened from it no longer turn red.
+
+### Fixed
+- Fixed that the red save-error highlighting and the "save failed" toasts stayed visible after leaving the annotation view without a page reload.
